  "statement": "For real numbers \\(a\\) and \\(b,\\) define \\(a \\diamond b = \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}.\\) What is the value of \\[(5 \\diamond 12) \\diamond ((-12) \\diamond (-5))?\\]",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\(0\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "\\(\\dfrac{17}{2}\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "C",
      "text": "\\(13\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "D",
      "text": "\\(13\\sqrt{2}\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "E",
      "text": "\\(26\\)"
    }
  ],
